System Reference Document 5.1
-----------------------------

Hero Step's rules are derived from the SRD: spell names and descriptions, the
goblin's stat block, ability-score modifiers, proficiency bonuses, the attack
and saving-throw maths, and the condition list. The SRD is dual-licensed under
OGL 1.0a and CC BY 4.0; this project uses the Creative Commons option, whose
required attribution is:

  This work includes material taken from the System Reference Document 5.1
  ("SRD 5.1") by Wizards of the Coast LLC and available at
  https://dnd.wizards.com/resources/systems-reference-document. The SRD 5.1 is
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License
  available at https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.

Hero Step diverges from the SRD deliberately in several places — the goblin's
Armour Class, movement on the tutorial board, subclasses offered at 1st level
rather than 3rd, and the duration of a paladin's oath powers. Those are the
project's choices, not the SRD's, and README.md explains each one. Nothing here
should be read as an official or endorsed representation of the rules.


