Interface ornaments
-------------------

`public/ui/divider-fantasy.png` and `public/ui/frame-corner.png` are from the
"Fantasy UI Borders" pack by Kenney (https://kenney.nl/assets/fantasy-ui-borders),
released under Creative Commons Zero 1.0:

  License: (Creative Commons Zero, CC0)
  http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

  You can use this content for personal, educational, and commercial purposes.

  Support by crediting 'Kenney' or 'www.kenney.nl' (this is not a requirement)

CC0 waives copyright, so no credit is owed and none is rendered in the app. It
is recorded here anyway because this file's job is to name everything in the
project that somebody else made, not only the things that oblige us.

CC0 was a deliberate choice over the free tier of a stock library. Those licence
the work rather than waiving it, and require a visible credit wherever the asset
appears — a permanent obligation on the page, on top of the SRD attribution
above, in exchange for artwork of no greater use.
